      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.786 - It was narrated by Abdullah ibn Sinan from Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as), was asked about a man who has nothing but trousers (for covering).\nImam (as) said: \"He should untie the waistband and place it over his shoulder and pray. If he has a sword but no garment, he should hang the sword around himself and pray standing”."
        ]
      }
